 "."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->265610514,ExpressionUUID->"086fbf29-695c-47b6-95bf-b8009bc3e326"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["DecodeCyclicTagToNaryCyclicTag"]], 
    "paclet:EricJamesParfitt/CyclicTagCompiler/ref/\
DecodeCyclicTagToNaryCyclicTag", "EricJamesParfitt Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "387af00b-0cc6-45f5-8b12-9c7970fa9942"],
 " keeps every ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["states", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "41b1bd3f-0539-484a-8d88-746980e3fa75"],
 "-th tape, which is where a step of the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["n", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "67eec2d5-bea4-4e6d-bfe3-b1ac544a7548"],
 "-ary system ends, and turns each block of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["states", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "1981ff48-846c-4f9b-aa46-2f17288fcb67"],
 " cells back into a symbol."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->754316963,ExpressionUUID->"933bea42-97b5-450f-bb36-54f766c69698"],

Cell["The following options can be given:", "Notes",
 CellID->773791850,ExpressionUUID->"63726b7f-0513-4dd1-aac2-6dd8ce3126cd"],

Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
   {Cell["      ", "TableRowIcon",ExpressionUUID->
     "9590a9ef-57b2-49a6-b470-4c64e3183ff9"], "\"\<TargetSystem\>\"", 
    TemplateBox[{
      Cell[
       TextData["Automatic"]], "paclet:ref/Automatic"},
     "RefLink",
     BaseStyle->{"3ColumnTableMod"}], Cell[
    "the kind of cyclic tag system to compile to", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "7f956074-23ca-4adf-aed2-ade0dc891111"]},
   {Cell["      ", "TableRowIcon",ExpressionUUID->
     "85077836-dc04-4415-a947-25b64b7d72db"], "\"\<Optimization\>\"", \
"\"\<DeletedSymbolsHighest\>\"", Cell[
    "which optimization of the encoding to use", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "cf50259a-0513-41c6-8b7c-a9c7c3c4e5af"]}
  }]], "3ColumnTableMod",
 GridBoxOptions->{
 GridBoxBackground->{"Columns" -> {{None}}, "Rows" -> {None, {None}}},
 GridBoxDividers->{"Rows" -> {{True, True, True}}}},
 CellID->519368861,ExpressionUUID->"674bbe19-ef22-4b04-bc2e-54c3dfc50b6a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The rule, initial condition, step count and decoding of one compilation \
must all use the same number of symbols and the same ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<TargetSystem\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "000f7982-64fe-4934-8175-5525b50d852b"],
 " setting."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->561698488,ExpressionUUID->"831db7f9-6037-4ac2-8d39-5917af779c0b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "With ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\"\<Optimization\>\"", " ", "->", 
   " ", "\"\<DeletedSymbolsHighest\>\""}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "2e4ccd66-1a2a-48f1-a428-fff5990b8270"],
 ", the default, the symbol columns that every ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["n", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "543a39a1-f0a2-426e-b90d-8325ff3ff2a8"],
 "-ary rule part leaves empty are left out of the encoding. Nothing in the \
compiled cyclic tag system ever appends for those symbols, so leaving them \
out makes every block narrower and every step cheaper."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->707100049,ExpressionUUID->"c778a509-8a4b-497e-90a1-8293c1705c95"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The compilation is then faithful up to a relabeling of the symbols: each \
symbol that survives is renamed to its position among the survivors, and \
every symbol that is left out decodes to one label that no surviving symbol \
uses. The decoded evolution therefore behaves like the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["n", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "e464141e-926f-4037-8018-9636ecfdd1d1"],
 "-ary one with its symbols renumbered, and is identical to it when there is \
nothing to leave out."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->707100056,ExpressionUUID->"97f2424f-93d2-4903-bb69-f1b1d350d3ec"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "No other setting is implemented yet. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["DecodeCyclicTagToNaryCyclicTag"]], 
    "paclet:EricJamesParfitt/CyclicTagCompiler/ref/\
DecodeCyclicTagToNaryCyclicTag", "EricJamesParfitt Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "169c74a2-54f9-4094-a8be-18be5dd44405"],
 " stays unevaluated when it is given any other value, rather than quietly \
compiling something else."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->707100063,ExpressionUUID->"d10a2016-2a6b-4ff0-bc57-ce8fe7fa3c9c"]
}, Closed]],

